/-!
# Proof-carrying celebration capacity and future-birth pulse

The consumer installs the generic source-specific producer in the canonical
history.  Depths six and seven are the first two positive reopening currents:
each keeps the admitted residual carried and independently consumed while the
same existing `.t1` bearer obtains an uncaptured non-work `leave` future.

The finite pulse is certified only as a numerical readout.  Its strongest
negative controls reject occurrence, authority, faithful, and generated-next
reconstruction.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

